# Screenshot: can-run output
Output assets/can-run-out.gif

Set Shell "zsh"
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1200
Set Height 300
Set Padding 20

Type "local-llmup can-run qwen3:8b"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "local-llmup can-run deepseek-r1:671b"
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Screenshot assets/screenshot-can-run.png
